<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.300" end="00:00:04.400" style="s2">I&#39;3m Lucy Hart.</p>
<p begin="00:00:01.800" end="00:00:06.400" style="s2">After college, to save rent, four</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.400" end="00:00:07.800" style="s2">college roommates and I rented a place</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.400" end="00:00:10.100" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.800" end="00:00:12.100" style="s2">But a few days later, my roommate Clara</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.100" end="00:00:13.700" style="s2">brought her boyfriend Ethan to stay.</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.100" end="00:00:15.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My boyfriend came for work. He can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.700" end="00:00:16.200" style="s2">afford a hotel. Can he crash in the</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.600" end="00:00:18.200" style="s2">living room?</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.200" end="00:00:20.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last time around, her boyfriend gave me</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.200" end="00:00:23.100" style="s2">bad vibes, so I wouldn&#39;t let him in.</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.900" end="00:00:26.200" style="s2">Everyone called me heartless. Just a few</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.100" end="00:00:28.300" style="s2">nights on a couch. Who are you guarding?</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.200" end="00:00:30.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We all struggle. Everyone has hard</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.300" end="00:00:30.800" style="s2">times.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.000" end="00:00:36.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Later, Clara edited our argument into a</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.500" end="00:00:37.900" style="s2">recording and posted it online. I became</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.000" end="00:00:40.500" style="s2">the evil roommate who drove someone to</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.900" end="00:00:42.400" style="s2">sleep on the streets. Get out. His</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.500" end="00:00:44.800" style="s2">inability to afford a hotel isn&#39;t my</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.400" end="00:00:46.700" style="s2">problem. I won&#39;t let him move in. Abuse</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.800" end="00:00:48.200" style="s2">followed me from my phone to work, then</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.700" end="00:00:51.600" style="s2">to my mother&#39;s phone.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.200" end="00:00:51.600" style="s2">I didn&#39;t survive that winter.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.100" end="00:00:58.800" style="s2">I&#39;m reborn.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.100" end="00:01:00.200" style="s2">I was reborn on the day Clara was</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.800" end="00:01:01.100" style="s2">bringing her boyfriend in.</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.200" end="00:01:03.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.100" end="00:01:05.800" style="s2">just a few days, really. Ethan&#39;s from</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.600" end="00:01:07.800" style="s2">the country. He came here for work. He</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.800" end="00:01:10.700" style="s2">arrives tomorrow night. He barely has</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.800" end="00:01:12.600" style="s2">money. They cost two or 300 a night. He</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.700" end="00:01:14.200" style="s2">can&#39;t justify that. Can he come stay</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.600" end="00:01:16.700" style="s2">with us a few days?</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.200" end="00:01:18.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re all women. Let&#39;s be understanding.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.700" end="00:01:19.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You all want to be saints. Then this</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.700" end="00:01:22.400" style="s2">time,</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.700" end="00:01:23.400" style="s2">I won&#39;t meddle again. I&#39;m asking.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.400" end="00:01:25.700" style="s2">Don&#39;t ignore me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.400" end="00:01:28.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, he&#39;s broke. He&#39;ll sleep in the</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.700" end="00:01:30.800" style="s2">living room, not your room, and won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.300" end="00:01:32.700" style="s2">bother anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.800" end="00:01:34.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where will he stay?</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.700" end="00:01:34.700" style="s2">Not my problem.</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.000" end="00:01:38.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.700" end="00:01:40.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy, are you always this stingy?</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.400" end="00:01:42.400" style="s2">This time, I won&#39;t rush to the door or</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.800" end="00:01:44.200" style="s2">argue with them.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.400" end="00:01:45.300" style="s2">I won&#39;t argue over the lease.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.200" end="00:01:47.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.300" end="00:01:47.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t rent.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.800" end="00:01:54.500" style="s2">Fine. Good. Leave.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.400" end="00:01:54.500" style="s2">Ethan can sleep better that way.</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.200" end="00:01:59.700" style="s2">A recording.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.600" end="00:02:00.992" style="s2">In my past life, I lost it arguing with</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.700" end="00:02:03.292" style="s2">them missed that move.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.992" end="00:02:05.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy, do you just look down on Ethan</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.292" end="00:02:06.792" style="s2">because he&#39;s from the country and think</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.092" end="00:02:08.592" style="s2">he&#39;s not good enough to live with us?</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.792" end="00:02:10.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan just got to this city. He doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.592" end="00:02:12.092" style="s2">know anyone, and one word from you gets</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.592" end="00:02:13.692" style="s2">him thrown out.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.092" end="00:02:15.492" style="s2">Don&#39;t you think that&#39;s cruel? I object</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.692" end="00:02:17.292" style="s2">to letting a man we don&#39;t know into our</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.492" end="00:02:19.992" style="s2">women only home without every tenant&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.292" end="00:02:21.092" style="s2">consent. His income, hometown, and job</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.992" end="00:02:23.192" style="s2">status don&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.092" end="00:02:24.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean a stranger? He&#39;s my</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.192" end="00:02:26.292" style="s2">boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.192" end="00:02:28.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To me, he&#39;s a stranger.</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.292" end="00:02:30.292" style="s2">The bath&#39;s off the living room.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.292" end="00:02:32.092" style="s2">Laundry hangs on the balcony.</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.292" end="00:02:34.292" style="s2">Bathroom trips at night, washing up in</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.092" end="00:02:35.692" style="s2">the morning, changing clothes, grabbing</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.292" end="00:02:36.992" style="s2">underwear isn&#39;t something to share with</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.692" end="00:02:38.392" style="s2">your boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.992" end="00:02:40.492" style="s2">Why the [music] drama?</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.392" end="00:02:42.192" style="s2">Is he going to eat you? At around 8:40</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.492" end="00:02:44.292" style="s2">tonight, Clara proposed that her</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.192" end="00:02:46.192" style="s2">boyfriend, Ethan, sleep in our shared</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.292" end="00:02:48.092" style="s2">living room. I do not consent to this</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.192" end="00:02:50.192" style="s2">adult man entering our women only shared</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.092" end="00:02:52.892" style="s2">space. Landlord and agent, please</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.192" end="00:02:54.892" style="s2">confirm the lease terms and next steps.</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.892" end="00:02:56.992" style="s2">If the others still insist, I&#39;ll move</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.892" end="00:02:59.892" style="s2">out soon, but that doesn&#39;t mean I agree</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.992" end="00:02:59.892" style="s2">to him moving in.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.092" end="00:03:08.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The lease forbids it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.492" end="00:03:11.392" style="s2">No overnight guests,</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.092" end="00:03:13.192" style="s2">especially if it affects others.</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.392" end="00:03:16.092" style="s2">Must you take it this far? If the</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.192" end="00:03:17.992" style="s2">landlord finds out, she&#39;ll kick him out.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.092" end="00:03:20.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You brought him in uninvited and won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.992" end="00:03:22.592" style="s2">tell the landlord.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.592" end="00:03:25.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She doesn&#39;t [music] live here. Must I</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.592" end="00:03:25.492" style="s2">tell her everything?</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.392" end="00:03:33.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ignore her.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.592" end="00:03:33.692" style="s2">She&#39;s just provoking you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.792" end="00:03:36.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.992" end="00:03:37.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy,</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.092" end="00:03:38.792" style="s2">do you really think being poor means</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.692" end="00:03:42.392" style="s2">we&#39;re beneath you?</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.792" end="00:03:42.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have to risk it with you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.292" end="00:03:52.792" style="s2">Is that you in this video?</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.992" end="00:03:57.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My boyfriend came for work, lost his</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.592" end="00:03:59.592" style="s2">wallet, had nowhere to go.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.892" end="00:04:01.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t live with your boyfriend. He</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.592" end="00:04:03.492" style="s2">can&#39;t stay here.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.492" end="00:04:05.394" style="s2">Nice clean edit.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.492" end="00:04:07.494" style="s2">You my words about an adult male</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.394" end="00:04:07.794" style="s2">stranger sharing space with women write</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.494" end="00:04:09.694" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.794" end="00:04:12.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hate these posh girls, renting a</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.694" end="00:04:14.894" style="s2">cubicle, acting rich. He only sleeps in</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.694" end="00:04:17.794" style="s2">the living room, not her bed.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.894" end="00:04:19.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I live here too. Some people are just</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.794" end="00:04:22.294" style="s2">hard to live with.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.394" end="00:04:22.294" style="s2">Coldhearted.</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.794" end="00:04:27.294" style="s2">Full recording. Clara&#39;s post was</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.394" end="00:04:29.194" style="s2">deceptively edited.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.294" end="00:04:30.794" style="s2">I oppose an adult male stranger moving</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.194" end="00:04:33.994" style="s2">into our shared home.</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.794" end="00:04:33.994" style="s2">This isn&#39;t about income.</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.094" end="00:04:40.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy, how&#39;d this get online? The address</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.694" end="00:04:41.894" style="s2">isn&#39;t out, is it?</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.794" end="00:04:43.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.894" end="00:04:46.294" style="s2">But my profile photo and name are</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.294" end="00:04:47.994" style="s2">already out. Oh, what now? Dana, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.294" end="00:04:49.694" style="s2">move out tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.994" end="00:04:52.494" style="s2">I&#39;ll hand you the key.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.694" end="00:04:55.594" style="s2">Please check if Ethan entered the house.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.494" end="00:04:55.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be right over.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.694" end="00:05:02.194" style="s2">The lease bans guests from staying long</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.494" end="00:05:04.894" style="s2">term. He&#39;s only dropping bags. He may</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.194" end="00:05:07.894" style="s2">not stay tonight. Why push this so hard?</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.894" end="00:05:09.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be clear. Does he have building access?</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.894" end="00:05:12.094" style="s2">Will he stay overnight?</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.794" end="00:05:12.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.394" end="00:05:22.694" style="s2">That&#39;s her?</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.694" end="00:05:25.494" style="s2">Who knew? She&#39;s usually so mild.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.694" end="00:05:27.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I rushed to explain in my past life</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.494" end="00:05:30.494" style="s2">I just looked more pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.794" end="00:05:30.494" style="s2">But this time</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.094" end="00:05:39.294" style="s2">false claims about me are online. They</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.994" end="00:05:40.694" style="s2">may hurt the company&#39;s name. I&#39;ve saved</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.294" end="00:05:42.694" style="s2">the evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.694" end="00:05:44.694" style="s2">If anyone harasses the company, send</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.694" end="00:05:46.194" style="s2">them to legal or admin.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.694" end="00:05:48.994" style="s2">Focus on work.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.194" end="00:05:48.994" style="s2">Keep me posted.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.994" end="00:05:53.694" style="s2">Things hadn&#39;t gotten so bad that the</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.694" end="00:05:55.594" style="s2">whole world had abandoned me. If I</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.694" end="00:05:58.694" style="s2">showed the evidence up front,</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.594" end="00:05:58.694" style="s2">someone would hear me out.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.294" end="00:06:06.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here, slippers. See? She&#39;s so</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.195" end="00:06:08.495" style="s2">thoughtful.</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.895" end="00:06:10.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You must be Lucy.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.495" end="00:06:12.095" style="s2">Sorry to be a bother.</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.095" end="00:06:13.495" style="s2">I&#39;ll only stay a couple days.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.095" end="00:06:15.795" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave once I find a job.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.495" end="00:06:18.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I hadn&#39;t died once, I might have</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.795" end="00:06:20.895" style="s2">wondered if I was too sensitive.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.795" end="00:06:22.395" style="s2">I&#39;m back for my stuff. Happy now?</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.895" end="00:06:24.795" style="s2">The landlord just called me several</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.395" end="00:06:24.795" style="s2">times.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.595" end="00:06:30.295" style="s2">I&#39;m noting the items condition. You</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.295" end="00:06:30.295" style="s2">think we&#39;re thieves?</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.095" end="00:06:40.695" style="s2">He&#39;s looking at me as freshly washed</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.095" end="00:06:40.695" style="s2">underwear.</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.795" end="00:06:45.095" style="s2">He looks so casual.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.095" end="00:06:47.395" style="s2">If I told them, they wouldn&#39;t believe</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.095" end="00:06:47.395" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.795" end="00:06:51.895" style="s2">After that, Ethan quickly settled into</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.695" end="00:06:53.895" style="s2">the apartment. Day one, he felt bad</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.895" end="00:06:56.095" style="s2">staying for free, so he ordered everyone</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.895" end="00:06:58.495" style="s2">milk tea. Day two, the kitchen faucet</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.095" end="00:07:00.295" style="s2">leaked. He grabbed his toolbox, worked</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.495" end="00:07:02.795" style="s2">on it for half an hour, and actually</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.295" end="00:07:04.695" style="s2">fixed it. Day three, Emily&#39;s cat litter</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.795" end="00:07:07.995" style="s2">and bottled water came downstairs. He</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.695" end="00:07:10.295" style="s2">made trip after trip upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.995" end="00:07:12.595" style="s2">Day four, Mia had a cold.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.295" end="00:07:15.895" style="s2">At 11:00 p.m., he went out for medicine</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.595" end="00:07:15.895" style="s2">and brought back hot porridge.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.795" end="00:07:22.495" style="s2">More reliable than people who just</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.495" end="00:07:25.895" style="s2">complain.</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.495" end="00:07:25.895" style="s2">Ethan&#39;s hot and kind.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.095" end="00:07:29.795" style="s2">I&#39;ve been looking at short stays.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.095" end="00:07:34.095" style="s2">I&#39;ll take this one.</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.995" end="00:07:36.295" style="s2">After I chose it, a locksmith rekeyed</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.095" end="00:07:37.995" style="s2">the lock. I bought a door stop and</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.295" end="00:07:40.095" style="s2">camera.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.995" end="00:07:41.695" style="s2">Moving day, I went back for my last two</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.095" end="00:07:43.895" style="s2">boxes of books.</p>
