<p begin="00:16:34.502" end="00:16:39.302" style="s2">everyone upstairs and down would know.</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.202" end="00:16:41.402" style="s2">How could Ethan find work?</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.302" end="00:16:43.502" style="s2">Lucy, were you just waiting to laugh at</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.402" end="00:16:45.702" style="s2">me and say I brought a thug home?</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.502" end="00:16:47.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Afraid it&#39;ll blow up or cops find</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.702" end="00:16:49.102" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.202" end="00:16:52.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t air our dirty laundry.</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.102" end="00:16:54.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s look into it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.302" end="00:16:56.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hand it over.</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.302" end="00:16:58.202" style="s2">Why should you see it? You a cop?</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.702" end="00:17:00.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clara, it&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.202" end="00:17:00.702" style="s2">Let her.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.802" end="00:17:07.302" style="s2">Go ahead. I have nothing to hide.</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.102" end="00:17:17.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s nothing on here.</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.802" end="00:17:20.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There really is nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.902" end="00:17:24.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe just a mistake?</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.702" end="00:17:24.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. I saw the flash.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.702" end="00:17:29.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you&#39;re scared. I get it. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.402" end="00:17:31.002" style="s2">find a place tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.402" end="00:17:33.402" style="s2">I won&#39;t bother you anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.002" end="00:17:35.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mia, you work late every day and can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.402" end="00:17:39.002" style="s2">sleep. He picked the wrong door. You got</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.602" end="00:17:41.202" style="s2">scared and assumed the worst.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.002" end="00:17:42.802" style="s2">Your fever&#39;s messing with you. If my</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.202" end="00:17:44.902" style="s2">boyfriend were like that, would I bring</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.802" end="00:17:47.202" style="s2">him home? Right?</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.902" end="00:17:50.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too drunk to find the right door, but he</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.202" end="00:17:52.602" style="s2">cleared recently deleted.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.702" end="00:17:54.102" style="s2">In my past life, a safety officer</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.602" end="00:17:55.502" style="s2">checked his phone.</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.102" end="00:17:58.702" style="s2">Found nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.502" end="00:17:58.702" style="s2">It wasn&#39;t on his phone.</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.102" end="00:18:03.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No words? Lucy, you moved out, then</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.002" end="00:18:06.202" style="s2">burst in late with the landlord and</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.502" end="00:18:08.402" style="s2">staff, kicked a door, grabbed people</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.202" end="00:18:10.902" style="s2">hoping Ethan gets hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.402" end="00:18:12.502" style="s2">You got shamed online last time. Now</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.902" end="00:18:15.002" style="s2">you&#39;re taking it out on him. The</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.502" end="00:18:18.802" style="s2">landlord&#39;s here, staff too. Be</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.002" end="00:18:20.603" style="s2">witnesses. You falsely accused Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.802" end="00:18:24.303" style="s2">In front of everyone, I want you to</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.603" end="00:18:24.303" style="s2">record a public apology.</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.703" end="00:18:29.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.603" end="00:18:32.103" style="s2">Yep. If I wrongly accused him,</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.403" end="00:18:34.503" style="s2">post a video apology.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.103" end="00:18:38.703" style="s2">But one condition, if I prove he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.503" end="00:18:38.703" style="s2">guilty, you both move out [music] now.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.003" end="00:18:46.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. The landlord and staff heard. You</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.503" end="00:18:47.903" style="s2">can testify.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.103" end="00:18:49.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.903" end="00:18:51.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard it, too.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.503" end="00:18:54.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mia, that video through the crack, is it</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.903" end="00:18:57.503" style="s2">still there?</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.503" end="00:18:59.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I kept filming from the floor,</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.503" end="00:19:02.403" style="s2">but it was too dark.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.403" end="00:19:02.403" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t see a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.103" end="00:19:10.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This dark? What can you see? This is her</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.403" end="00:19:11.803" style="s2">proof? Just black and one light?</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.303" end="00:19:15.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I explained.</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.803" end="00:19:15.003" style="s2">That light was my flashlight.</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.303" end="00:19:19.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy, everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.803" end="00:19:28.303" style="s2">Proof&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.503" end="00:19:31.103" style="s2">In the TV stand outlet, [music] a</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.303" end="00:19:33.303" style="s2">pinhole camera.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.103" end="00:19:35.403" style="s2">Those videos from my past life always</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.303" end="00:19:37.303" style="s2">showed the bedroom door. The camera was</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.403" end="00:19:39.503" style="s2">this high. When I came back for my</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.303" end="00:19:41.803" style="s2">books, you were crouched right here</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.503" end="00:19:43.003" style="s2">fixing this outlet.</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.803" end="00:19:45.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.003" end="00:19:47.403" style="s2">This outlet was loose a few days ago. I</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.003" end="00:19:47.403" style="s2">fixed it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.703" end="00:19:52.003" style="s2">That red light&#39;s an indicator.</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.803" end="00:19:53.503" style="s2">It stayed on after I fixed it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.003" end="00:19:54.903" style="s2">How is it a pinhole camera?</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.503" end="00:19:57.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does it have a light?</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.903" end="00:19:59.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maintenance. Do outlets like this have</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.203" end="00:19:59.703" style="s2">lights?</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.703" end="00:20:05.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are our standard wall outlets. No</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.903" end="00:20:06.303" style="s2">indicator lights.</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.503" end="00:20:08.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.303" end="00:20:10.803" style="s2">faces our door.</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.603" end="00:20:11.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then that doesn&#39;t prove it&#39;s a pinhole</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.803" end="00:20:15.503" style="s2">camera.</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.703" end="00:20:15.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, lend me that screwdriver.</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.103" end="00:20:19.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why touch things here?</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.703" end="00:20:20.603" style="s2">You&#39;re accusing us with no proof, my</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.503" end="00:20:22.703" style="s2">house.</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.603" end="00:20:24.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told her to.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.703" end="00:20:24.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy, it&#39;s late.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.103" end="00:20:25.505" style="s2">Break</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.405" end="00:20:27.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; it. We need repairs.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.505" end="00:20:27.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hands off.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.105" end="00:20:41.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.905" end="00:20:43.905" style="s2">It really is.</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.505" end="00:20:43.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.205" end="00:20:46.105" style="s2">Now</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.105" end="00:20:48.305" style="s2">do you still think they were</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.105" end="00:20:50.705" style="s2">overreacting?</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.305" end="00:20:53.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d better explain this.</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.705" end="00:20:54.405" style="s2">How did this get in my house?</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.505" end="00:20:57.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your room.</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.405" end="00:20:57.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I had him install it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.405" end="00:21:04.705" style="s2">I I&#39;m pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.005" end="00:21:07.005" style="s2">I brought him in. If he was spying, I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.705" end="00:21:08.905" style="s2">be the one who let a wolf into our home.</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.005" end="00:21:10.505" style="s2">I can&#39;t let Lucy think she was right</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.905" end="00:21:12.305" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.505" end="00:21:15.105" style="s2">The day Lucy moved out</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.305" end="00:21:17.405" style="s2">he&#39;s changed hands so often. Who knows</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.105" end="00:21:18.705" style="s2">if someone made a copy. I was too scared</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.405" end="00:21:21.005" style="s2">to sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.705" end="00:21:24.405" style="s2">That&#39;s why Ethan installed it</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.005" end="00:21:24.405" style="s2">to watch the door for us.</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.205" end="00:21:28.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t think it through. I told no</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.505" end="00:21:29.705" style="s2">one.</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.505" end="00:21:32.005" style="s2">I feared for him and baby.</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.705" end="00:21:34.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean her was locking up tonight</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.005" end="00:21:34.705" style="s2">concern?</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.005" end="00:21:41.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mia, we&#39;ve shared a room for four years.</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.905" end="00:21:45.105" style="s2">If he were that kind of man, would I let</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.905" end="00:21:45.105" style="s2">him sleep by our door?</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.205" end="00:21:51.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clara, why didn&#39;t you tell us?</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.105" end="00:21:52.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I had it installed.</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.205" end="00:21:53.905" style="s2">Ethan&#39;s innocent.</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.805" end="00:21:56.705" style="s2">This bat</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.905" end="00:21:58.905" style="s2">we&#39;ll call it a tie.</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.705" end="00:22:02.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s a tie?</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.905" end="00:22:02.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello. Did someone call 911?</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.505" end="00:22:07.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I called the cops. Someone tried a</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.305" end="00:22:09.105" style="s2">girl&#39;s bedroom door at night.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.605" end="00:22:11.505" style="s2">This pinhole camera came out of an</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.105" end="00:22:14.505" style="s2">outlet aimed at her door.</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.505" end="00:22:14.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s involved?</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.005" end="00:22:20.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a mix-up. He was drunk. Wrong door.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.305" end="00:22:21.305" style="s2">Clara had it installed to keep strangers</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.505" end="00:22:25.605" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.305" end="00:22:27.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. Clara&#39;s pregnant. We all know.</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.605" end="00:22:29.406" style="s2">Guess you never learn.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.406" end="00:22:31.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Half an hour ago, you called me crying,</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.406" end="00:22:32.206" style="s2">begging me to call the cops. That was a</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.306" end="00:22:34.206" style="s2">mix-up.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.206" end="00:22:36.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.206" end="00:22:38.506" style="s2">Just let it go.</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.906" end="00:22:39.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you install cameras, tell your</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.506" end="00:22:41.306" style="s2">housemates</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.906" end="00:22:43.206" style="s2">drink less.</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.306" end="00:22:46.006" style="s2">No more late night trouble. If that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.206" end="00:22:46.006" style="s2">all, we&#39;ll go.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.606" end="00:22:53.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy,</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.806" end="00:22:55.606" style="s2">thanks for coming tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.206" end="00:22:56.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You falsely accused him, lost the bet</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.606" end="00:22:59.006" style="s2">too. Why stay?</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.806" end="00:23:01.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In my past life, I argued here till</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.006" end="00:23:03.706" style="s2">dawn, desperate to stay and protect</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.306" end="00:23:05.306" style="s2">them. They kicked me out in the end. I</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.706" end="00:23:08.306" style="s2">lost everything.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.306" end="00:23:10.206" style="s2">This time around, I won&#39;t get involved.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.306" end="00:23:12.006" style="s2">I&#39;ll wait till you get desperate and</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.206" end="00:23:13.806" style="s2">slip up.</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.006" end="00:23:18.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still lying?</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.806" end="00:23:18.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dana, handyman, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.906" end="00:23:32.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy Hart.</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.406" end="00:23:33.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, you still can&#39;t do it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.006" end="00:23:36.106" style="s2">That woman</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.306" end="00:23:36.106" style="s2">has to go.</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.206" end="00:23:41.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.306" end="00:23:42.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s pregnant. They both say it&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.406" end="00:23:45.806" style="s2">mix-up.</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.906" end="00:23:48.306" style="s2">I can&#39;t push it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.806" end="00:23:48.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.206" end="00:23:54.506" style="s2">Dana, the hall and entrance need</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.406" end="00:23:56.506" style="s2">cameras.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.506" end="00:23:58.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;ll cost a lot.</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.506" end="00:24:00.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He has an access card.</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.406" end="00:24:01.706" style="s2">When he comes in, when he leaves, you&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.306" end="00:24:03.706" style="s2">never know.</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.706" end="00:24:05.106" style="s2">Tonight, in your own place, we pulled</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.706" end="00:24:06.706" style="s2">out a camera.</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.106" end="00:24:09.606" style="s2">If anything happens later, they&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.706" end="00:24:09.606" style="s2">question you first.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.106" end="00:24:12.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.906" end="00:24:14.406" style="s2">I&#39;ll get it installed tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.706" end="00:24:16.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If anything looks off, tell me right</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.406" end="00:24:18.506" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.006" end="00:24:20.906" style="s2">In my past life, every dirty deed in</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.506" end="00:24:22.706" style="s2">this house was pinned on me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.906" end="00:24:24.806" style="s2">I had nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.706" end="00:24:26.506" style="s2">This time, who comes and goes needs to</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.806" end="00:24:29.306" style="s2">be on record.</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.506" end="00:24:29.306" style="s2">I have to stay</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.007" end="00:24:34.408" style="s2">Promise me something too.</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.908" end="00:24:37.207" style="s2">Next time don&#39;t rush in alone.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.408" end="00:24:39.507" style="s2">What if he had a knife?</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.207" end="00:24:39.507" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.316" end="00:24:42.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.207" end="00:24:48.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have some water. Calm your nerves.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.107" end="00:24:49.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan,</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.107" end="00:24:50.507" style="s2">you want me to lie to the safety</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.207" end="00:24:53.007" style="s2">officer?</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.507" end="00:24:54.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. It&#39;s solid wood. Shut it and they</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.007" end="00:24:55.507" style="s2">won&#39;t hear a thing.</p>
