<p begin="00:24:55.507" end="00:24:59.707" style="s2">camera. I didn&#39;t even know when you put</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.408" end="00:25:03.107" style="s2">it in. Why hide it in the outlet? Why</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.707" end="00:25:03.107" style="s2">point it right at our bedroom door?</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.707" end="00:25:07.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clara,</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.207" end="00:25:09.007" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.408" end="00:25:10.807" style="s2">I installed it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.007" end="00:25:12.908" style="s2">I was afraid to tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.807" end="00:25:15.807" style="s2">I didn&#39;t want you to worry.</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.908" end="00:25:17.607" style="s2">When Lucy left, she hated us so much.</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.807" end="00:25:19.107" style="s2">With the keys changing hands, who knows</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.607" end="00:25:20.307" style="s2">if she kept one?</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.107" end="00:25:22.207" style="s2">What if she comes back at night and</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.307" end="00:25:23.707" style="s2">attacks you or the baby?</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.207" end="00:25:26.107" style="s2">I just wanted to watch the door and see</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.707" end="00:25:28.707" style="s2">who came in.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.107" end="00:25:30.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did you try my door tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.707" end="00:25:32.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I really was drunk.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.507" end="00:25:35.607" style="s2">You were in there.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.007" end="00:25:35.607" style="s2">Is trying my girlfriend&#39;s door a crime?</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.707" end="00:25:39.307" style="s2">She looks down on me. Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.908" end="00:25:41.007" style="s2">I&#39;m from the country.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.307" end="00:25:42.107" style="s2">No money, no prospects.</p>
