<p begin="00:25:42.107" end="00:25:46.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She looks down on you too. She kicked</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.408" end="00:25:48.607" style="s2">the door in today just to show everyone</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.408" end="00:25:49.607" style="s2">what a loser you ended up with.</p>
