<p begin="00:25:49.607" end="00:25:53.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When the baby&#39;s born, I&#39;ll marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.307" end="00:25:54.707" style="s2">After that, I won&#39;t let anyone look down</p>
