<p begin="00:32:22.212" end="00:32:25.112" style="s2">her face.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.512" end="00:32:28.712" style="s2">I&#39;ll live stream it for everyone so they</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.112" end="00:32:28.712" style="s2">can see what kind of person she is.</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.512" end="00:32:36.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Idiot. With you out in front, I can sit</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.112" end="00:32:36.312" style="s2">back and enjoy the show.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.712" end="00:32:44.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy, she&#39;s heading to your office now</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.913" end="00:32:44.613" style="s2">to live stream.</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.013" end="00:32:50.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A day earlier than in my past life.</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.313" end="00:32:52.713" style="s2">My trap isn&#39;t set yet.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.113" end="00:32:52.713" style="s2">I need to hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.113" end="00:33:02.213" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.013" end="00:33:04.513" style="s2">Boss, I heard my former roommate is</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.213" end="00:33:06.113" style="s2">coming to cause a scene at work.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.513" end="00:33:08.613" style="s2">I ask two things.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.113" end="00:33:10.613" style="s2">When she comes, don&#39;t kick her out.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.613" end="00:33:12.313" style="s2">Let her say it all in front of everyone</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.613" end="00:33:14.613" style="s2">and don&#39;t judge me yet.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.313" end="00:33:16.513" style="s2">I&#39;ll take each claim apart right there.</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.613" end="00:33:18.513" style="s2">I&#39;m fully prepared.</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.513" end="00:33:19.913" style="s2">I just didn&#39;t expect it today.</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.513" end="00:33:22.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know what it means if this comes</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.913" end="00:33:23.413" style="s2">to our office?</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.113" end="00:33:26.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.413" end="00:33:26.513" style="s2">That&#39;s why I came to you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.713" end="00:33:31.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This project&#39;s due next month.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.313" end="00:33:32.613" style="s2">Only she can handle it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.213" end="00:33:34.713" style="s2">That online mess,</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.613" end="00:33:36.313" style="s2">she put proof first at every step.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.713" end="00:33:37.813" style="s2">She&#39;s meticulous.</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.313" end="00:33:41.213" style="s2">Since you&#39;re prepared,</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.813" end="00:33:41.213" style="s2">I&#39;ll take that risk with you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.213" end="00:33:44.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.213" end="00:33:52.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She went to see the boss again, all</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.413" end="00:33:54.813" style="s2">secretive.</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.613" end="00:33:56.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That online mess last time had the whole</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.813" end="00:33:57.913" style="s2">department questioned.</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.413" end="00:33:58.913" style="s2">Now she&#39;s bringing more trouble into the</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.913" end="00:34:00.913" style="s2">office.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.913" end="00:34:04.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think she&#39;s just paranoid, always</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.913" end="00:34:04.213" style="s2">watching for thieves.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.513" end="00:34:08.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since you think my situation&#39;s such a</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.013" end="00:34:09.913" style="s2">hassle, do me a favor.</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.113" end="00:34:11.313" style="s2">When she gets here, get your phones out</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.913" end="00:34:12.913" style="s2">and record everything.</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.313" end="00:34:14.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why should we listen to you?</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.913" end="00:34:16.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I really am at fault, you&#39;ll have</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.513" end="00:34:18.313" style="s2">proof in your hands.</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.013" end="00:34:20.113" style="s2">Post it wherever you want. If I&#39;m not,</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.313" end="00:34:21.413" style="s2">when the higher-ups ask, you&#39;ll have an</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.113" end="00:34:23.513" style="s2">answer for them.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.413" end="00:34:24.413" style="s2">The department won&#39;t take the blame.</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.513" end="00:34:27.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.413" end="00:34:28.213" style="s2">You ask us to record it. Um, don&#39;t blame</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.013" end="00:34:30.413" style="s2">us later.</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.213" end="00:34:30.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.713" end="00:34:34.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is she crazy having us film her</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.913" end="00:34:37.613" style="s2">humiliation?</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.913" end="00:34:40.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This should be fun to watch.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.613" end="00:34:40.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s downstairs at your building.</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.313" end="00:34:47.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come Clara.</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.014" end="00:34:49.214" style="s2">I&#39;m waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.114" end="00:34:51.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Um, you can&#39;t go in.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.214" end="00:34:54.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, everyone. It&#39;s her, Lucy Hart.</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.914" end="00:34:56.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She actually came. She told us to film.</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.714" end="00:34:58.814" style="s2">She wasn&#39;t kidding.</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.314" end="00:34:59.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see who she pissed off. Don&#39;t stop</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.814" end="00:35:01.919" style="s2">her yet.</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.814" end="00:35:02.514" style="s2">Let her finish.</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.919" end="00:35:04.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.514" end="00:35:06.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My boyfriend came from the country to</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.114" end="00:35:08.414" style="s2">find work in the city. He slept in our</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.414" end="00:35:10.414" style="s2">living room for a few days.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.414" end="00:35:12.714" style="s2">But she waited till I left, then hit on</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.414" end="00:35:13.814" style="s2">my boyfriend. He turned her down, so she</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.714" end="00:35:15.914" style="s2">brought people into our home at</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.814" end="00:35:18.114" style="s2">midnight. She called the cops, said my</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.914" end="00:35:20.214" style="s2">boyfriend secretly filmed her, and I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.114" end="00:35:21.914" style="s2">pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.214" end="00:35:23.614" style="s2">She broke in at midnight. I was too</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.914" end="00:35:26.314" style="s2">scared to sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.614" end="00:35:28.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She hit on someone else&#39;s boyfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.314" end="00:35:30.814" style="s2">No wonder she&#39;s been backing stuff up</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.314" end="00:35:33.214" style="s2">for days. Did she already know they&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.814" end="00:35:33.914" style="s2">show up here and prepare her story ahead</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.214" end="00:35:36.014" style="s2">of time?</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.914" end="00:35:37.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Film it all. Don&#39;t drag our department</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.014" end="00:35:40.414" style="s2">into this again.</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.114" end="00:35:41.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You say I hit on your boyfriend. When?</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.414" end="00:35:42.414" style="s2">Where?</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.414" end="00:35:43.914" style="s2">How did I do it?</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.414" end="00:35:46.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.914" end="00:35:48.014" style="s2">Nice act. You&#39;re live.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.314" end="00:35:49.314" style="s2">Thousands are watching.</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.014" end="00:35:51.914" style="s2">Spell it out.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.314" end="00:35:53.914" style="s2">Let them decide.</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.914" end="00:35:54.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, I&#39;ll talk. The day you came back</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.914" end="00:35:57.114" style="s2">for your coat.</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.814" end="00:35:57.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The day I got my coat in our shared</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.114" end="00:35:58.614" style="s2">living room.</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.914" end="00:36:00.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.614" end="00:36:03.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; While we were all out, you added my</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.714" end="00:36:05.514" style="s2">boyfriend on WeChat. You told him he was</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.414" end="00:36:06.614" style="s2">too good for me, and you could help him</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.514" end="00:36:07.614" style="s2">leave me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.614" end="00:36:09.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh god.</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.614" end="00:36:12.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Nothing to say?</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.114" end="00:36:14.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything else? Say it all now.</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.114" end="00:36:16.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. You won&#39;t admit it until you</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.514" end="00:36:18.814" style="s2">see proof.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.014" end="00:36:20.714" style="s2">Hey, everyone. Look at this next one.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.814" end="00:36:23.314" style="s2">Look closely. These are the private</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.714" end="00:36:26.114" style="s2">photos she secretly sent my boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.314" end="00:36:29.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Private photos, too? If that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.114" end="00:36:31.414" style="s2">true, she still dared us to record.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.114" end="00:36:33.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep recording. It&#39;s all evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.414" end="00:36:35.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There it is.</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.114" end="00:36:37.414" style="s2">Clara, the harder you hit, the harder</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.514" end="00:36:39.814" style="s2">you&#39;ll fall.</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.414" end="00:36:41.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy, like you told me before, explain</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.814" end="00:36:43.414" style="s2">it to everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.614" end="00:36:45.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll get to the photos.</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.414" end="00:36:48.516" style="s2">First, her claim that the day I got my</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.616" end="00:36:50.816" style="s2">coat, I hit on Ethan in the living room.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.516" end="00:36:53.516" style="s2">Since Ethan moved in, I&#39;ve been back to</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.816" end="00:36:54.716" style="s2">our place three times. Each time I went</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.516" end="00:36:57.516" style="s2">in,</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.716" end="00:37:00.016" style="s2">I filmed start to end.</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.516" end="00:37:02.216" style="s2">First time, all three of you were there.</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.016" end="00:37:03.516" style="s2">Second time, the day you said you got</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.216" end="00:37:06.516" style="s2">your coat,</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.516" end="00:37:08.716" style="s2">10 minutes filmed non-stop.</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.516" end="00:37:10.616" style="s2">My phone was filming. How could I add</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.716" end="00:37:12.316" style="s2">him on WeChat?</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.616" end="00:37:13.716" style="s2">Look closely.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.316" end="00:37:15.816" style="s2">Did I say a word to him?</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.716" end="00:37:17.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your blue coat, right? You left it over</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.816" end="00:37:19.716" style="s2">a chair two days ago.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.116" end="00:37:21.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Third time, he started talking to me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.716" end="00:37:22.516" style="s2">I didn&#39;t say a word.</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.416" end="00:37:24.116" style="s2">Three,</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.516" end="00:37:27.416" style="s2">under 30 minutes,</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.116" end="00:37:29.016" style="s2">all on video. At what minute did I</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.416" end="00:37:31.316" style="s2">seduce him?</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.016" end="00:37:33.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like she never spoke to Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.316" end="00:37:35.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, the photo&#39;s still unexplained.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.816" end="00:37:37.216" style="s2">What can video prove?</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.816" end="00:37:38.816" style="s2">Maybe you edited it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.216" end="00:37:40.016" style="s2">The photo you sent</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.816" end="00:37:41.416" style="s2">was real, right?</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.016" end="00:37:43.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.416" end="00:37:45.916" style="s2">Then let&#39;s discuss this so-called</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.616" end="00:37:47.516" style="s2">private photo.</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.916" end="00:37:48.516" style="s2">Three questions first.</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.516" end="00:37:49.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.516" end="00:37:50.616" style="s2">Let&#39;s see how you talk your way out of</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.816" end="00:37:51.516" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.616" end="00:37:53.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First,</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.516" end="00:37:54.316" style="s2">these photos, I took and posted them</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.516" end="00:37:56.316" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.316" end="00:37:56.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, you took them and posted</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.316" end="00:37:57.716" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.816" end="00:37:59.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Second,</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.716" end="00:38:02.216" style="s2">after the day I picked up my coat.</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.516" end="00:38:04.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, you started posting after that day.</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.216" end="00:38:06.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Third, were these photos altered by</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.316" end="00:38:08.516" style="s2">someone? Photoshopped?</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.016" end="00:38:09.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Photoshopped? These are originals. Not a</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.516" end="00:38:11.416" style="s2">pixel&#39;s been changed.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.816" end="00:38:13.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those three claims,</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.416" end="00:38:14.516" style="s2">thousands watching heard you say them.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.516" end="00:38:15.516" style="s2">Later,</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.516" end="00:38:16.516" style="s2">don&#39;t backpedal.</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.516" end="00:38:18.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? You&#39;re saying they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.516" end="00:38:20.416" style="s2">photoshopped? If you can&#39;t prove it,</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.616" end="00:38:24.316" style="s2">quit yapping.</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.416" end="00:38:24.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s my original profile photo.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.616" end="00:38:31.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That that face is identical.</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.216" end="00:38:33.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s her own face. Of course it matches.</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.216" end="00:38:34.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not the odd part.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.216" end="00:38:37.316" style="s2">But in the original, I&#39;m wearing a</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.916" end="00:38:39.416" style="s2">sweater and a scarf with ginkgo leaves</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.316" end="00:38:42.516" style="s2">all over the ground. The face in these</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.416" end="00:38:44.216" style="s2">photos matches that original exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.516" end="00:38:46.516" style="s2">The same face</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.216" end="00:38:46.717" style="s2">was pasted onto another body.</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.516" end="00:38:49.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.717" end="00:38:51.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; lying. It&#39;s just the angle. Then keep</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.517" end="00:38:53.517" style="s2">watching.</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.417" end="00:38:55.417" style="s2">First, look at the neck.</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.517" end="00:38:58.017" style="s2">Her face and neck are different colors.</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.417" end="00:38:59.917" style="s2">Second, the lighting. In the original,</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.017" end="00:39:01.817" style="s2">the sun&#39;s on my right.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.917" end="00:39:03.117" style="s2">My right cheek&#39;s lit. My left cheek&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.817" end="00:39:05.117" style="s2">shaded.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.117" end="00:39:07.317" style="s2">But this body is lit from the left. Left</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.117" end="00:39:08.517" style="s2">shoulder lit. Right shoulder dark. Same</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.317" end="00:39:10.917" style="s2">person.</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.517" end="00:39:12.817" style="s2">Light from both.</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.917" end="00:39:14.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s right. The face and body are lit</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.817" end="00:39:15.917" style="s2">from opposite sides.</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.217" end="00:39:17.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Third, the angle.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.917" end="00:39:19.617" style="s2">Take two photos.</p>
