<p begin="00:47:36.422" end="00:47:40.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring her tomorrow as interest.</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.523" end="00:47:43.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.523" end="00:47:44.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The soup&#39;s getting cold. Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.122" end="00:47:47.023" style="s2">You&#39;re all I have now.</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.723" end="00:47:49.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take you to meet someone tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.023" end="00:47:50.622" style="s2">He can help bury those videos online.</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.422" end="00:47:51.523" style="s2">You can start fresh.</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.622" end="00:47:54.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.523" end="00:47:54.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When have I ever lied to you?</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.622" end="00:47:59.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember to bring her tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.523" end="00:48:05.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who?</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.323" end="00:48:07.922" style="s2">Me?</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.523" end="00:48:10.023" style="s2">I&#39;m not scared of Ethan. I just think</p>
