<p begin="00:48:10.023" end="00:48:14.922" style="s2">again. He turned it twice. I held the</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.323" end="00:48:17.723" style="s2">latch till my hand went numb. He stayed</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.922" end="00:48:17.723" style="s2">right outside.</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.323" end="00:48:24.723" style="s2">Come sit.</p>
