<p begin="00:48:32.622" end="00:48:36.523" style="s2">texts. Don&#39;t call to explain.</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.223" end="00:48:38.523" style="s2">Say one line.</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.523" end="00:48:40.223" style="s2">The cat litter&#39;s here. That&#39;s it.</p>
