<p begin="00:48:43.422" end="00:48:48.323" style="s2">I got hurt alone in my past life.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.323" end="00:48:50.523" style="s2">Nobody ever found out. This time around,</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.323" end="00:48:52.823" style="s2">I can&#39;t be too careful. This is like a</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.523" end="00:48:54.523" style="s2">spy movie.</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.823" end="00:48:56.723" style="s2">Talk tough all you want.</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.523" end="00:48:58.823" style="s2">Just don&#39;t hold us back. I&#39;m tough, not</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.723" end="00:48:59.823" style="s2">stupid.</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.823" end="00:49:01.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan,</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.823" end="00:49:04.124" style="s2">why are there no lights here?</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.424" end="00:49:06.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Big shots meet where no one&#39;s around.</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.124" end="00:49:07.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once it&#39;s over, we&#39;ll go back home and</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.024" end="00:49:09.324" style="s2">get married, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.924" end="00:49:10.624" style="s2">When baby&#39;s born,</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.324" end="00:49:12.824" style="s2">you hold them first.</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.624" end="00:49:12.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Um</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.824" end="00:49:17.724" style="s2">Hahaha.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.024" end="00:49:18.524" style="s2">Is this your girlfriend?</p>
