<p begin="00:50:58.524" end="00:51:01.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One live stream</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.224" end="00:51:03.925" style="s2">one video</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.824" end="00:51:06.125" style="s2">wrecked half my group.</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.925" end="00:51:07.325" style="s2">They want the real thing.</p>
