<p begin="00:51:41.225" end="00:51:45.525" style="s2">you&#39;ve got all night.</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.925" end="00:51:47.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Record it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.525" end="00:51:50.725" style="s2">Say one extra word</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.725" end="00:51:52.225" style="s2">and you&#39;ll regret it right here.</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.725" end="00:51:54.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got plans tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.225" end="00:51:56.325" style="s2">I won&#39;t be home. Get some sleep. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.225" end="00:51:58.425" style="s2">wake up. Oh, and</p>
