<p begin="00:51:58.425" end="00:52:00.425" style="s2">up tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.125" end="00:52:02.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cat litter?</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.425" end="00:52:03.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My roommate has a cat.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.025" end="00:52:04.925" style="s2">Our group ordered her litter. I had to</p>
