<p begin="00:52:42.725" end="00:52:45.325" style="s2">an owner&#39;s place had a leak and drew me</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.225" end="00:52:47.625" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.325" end="00:52:49.125" style="s2">I got back 10 minutes later.</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.625" end="00:52:51.225" style="s2">She was gone.</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.125" end="00:52:53.025" style="s2">One shoe lay in the flower bed.</p>
