<p begin="00:53:37.627" end="00:53:41.927" style="s2">My group makes 500 per clip, hundreds of</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.127" end="00:53:44.427" style="s2">thousands a month.</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.927" end="00:53:47.027" style="s2">Your video said Ethan&#39;s sample was fake,</p>
