<p begin="00:53:47.027" end="00:53:51.427" style="s2">They wanted refunds or ran.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.627" end="00:53:52.927" style="s2">You call that no grudge?</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.427" end="00:53:53.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Ethan?</p>
