<p begin="00:55:36.328" end="00:55:39.928" style="s2">Soon, you&#39;re the group&#39;s fresh</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.128" end="00:55:42.128" style="s2">merchandise.</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.928" end="00:55:44.228" style="s2">They&#39;ll film you. Everyone online will</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.128" end="00:55:46.128" style="s2">see. Then they&#39;ll know what I said at</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.228" end="00:55:47.928" style="s2">your company was true.</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.128" end="00:55:51.728" style="s2">You seduced people.</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.928" end="00:55:51.728" style="s2">You&#39;re trash. You deserve it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.028" end="00:55:58.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She won&#39;t save me, them. The only one</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.728" end="00:55:58.228" style="s2">who can save me is me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.728" end="00:56:09.428" style="s2">It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.328" end="00:56:19.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy, we meet again.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.128" end="00:56:21.528" style="s2">Victor&#39;s busy downstairs. I&#39;ll make an</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.228" end="00:56:23.328" style="s2">example of you first.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.528" end="00:56:25.828" style="s2">So, when we start filming, you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.328" end="00:56:25.828" style="s2">behave.</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.028" end="00:56:31.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, you little sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.128" end="00:56:33.528" style="s2">You sold me to them and you dare stand</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.828" end="00:56:34.328" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.528" end="00:56:37.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.328" end="00:56:39.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m carrying your baby.</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.528" end="00:56:40.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That bastard in your belly, I don&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.728" end="00:56:42.828" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.828" end="00:56:45.228" style="s2">It might come out as dumb as you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.828" end="00:56:47.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.228" end="00:56:48.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy, haven&#39;t you always cared about</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.328" end="00:56:52.128" style="s2">your reputation?</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.928" end="00:56:54.128" style="s2">I&#39;ll brand s l u t on you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.128" end="00:56:56.328" style="s2">Then anyone who sees it will know what</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.128" end="00:56:59.128" style="s2">you are.</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.328" end="00:57:02.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brand her. Do it. Brand her.</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.128" end="00:57:04.528" style="s2">Lucy Heart, aren&#39;t you the clever one?</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.128" end="00:57:06.828" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you have it all figured out?</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.528" end="00:57:10.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not fast enough.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.828" end="00:57:12.429" style="s2">I have to stall him.</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.129" end="00:57:12.429" style="s2">Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.229" end="00:57:16.729" style="s2">Flora is hiding a knife.</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.929" end="00:57:22.529" style="s2">You sold her out.</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.129" end="00:57:22.529" style="s2">And you turn your back on her.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.729" end="00:57:28.829" style="s2">Lucy, shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.129" end="00:57:34.729" style="s2">Now that we&#39;re exposed, Ethan, just die.</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.229" end="00:57:47.829" style="s2">Stabbed me?</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.529" end="00:57:52.929" style="s2">I didn&#39;t expect this.</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.329" end="00:58:06.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on in there? Go look.</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.129" end="00:58:16.729" style="s2">What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.729" end="00:58:20.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.729" end="00:58:23.129" style="s2">dead.</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.829" end="00:58:23.129" style="s2">Where?</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.429" end="00:58:31.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget it. Go.</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.329" end="00:58:37.729" style="s2">The phone, the tripod, take everything.</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.029" end="00:58:37.729" style="s2">Leave nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.529" end="00:58:41.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There she is.</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.129" end="00:58:45.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even as she died, she wouldn&#39;t let me</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.829" end="00:58:47.029" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.929" end="00:58:48.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor,</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.029" end="00:58:50.329" style="s2">get me to the ER.</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.529" end="00:58:54.129" style="s2">I won&#39;t say a word. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.329" end="00:58:54.129" style="s2">If she escapes, you&#39;re done.</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.129" end="00:59:02.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run.</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.829" end="00:59:08.429" style="s2">Take her. The cash from selling her will</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.229" end="00:59:08.429" style="s2">get us back on top.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.829" end="00:59:14.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor, cops are here.</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.231" end="00:59:22.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her go.</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.331" end="00:59:22.631" style="s2">Now.</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.331" end="00:59:29.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy.</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.431" end="00:59:31.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Officer, you&#39;ve got it wrong. Those</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.431" end="00:59:33.531" style="s2">three started fighting.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.131" end="00:59:35.531" style="s2">I was just passing by.</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.531" end="00:59:37.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ] officer.</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.531" end="00:59:40.331" style="s2">Huh, she stabbed Ethan to death. He was</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.931" end="00:59:42.531" style="s2">my boyfriend. I was pregnant. I couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.331" end="00:59:44.031" style="s2">stop her. She made me lose the baby.</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.531" end="00:59:45.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.031" end="00:59:46.731" style="s2">She&#39;s the one who did it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.331" end="00:59:48.931" style="s2">When I walked in, he was already on the</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.731" end="00:59:48.931" style="s2">floor.</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.331" end="00:59:56.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. She even got the landlord and</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.531" end="00:59:59.731" style="s2">building staff to remove a camera. She&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.931" end="00:59:59.731" style="s2">kill someone.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.231" end="01:00:04.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clara, you edited audio to spread sexual</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.931" end="01:00:06.931" style="s2">rumors. Now you&#39;re framing her for</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.731" end="01:00:08.831" style="s2">murder.</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.931" end="01:00:11.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Officer, three men dragged Lucy away</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.831" end="01:00:13.831" style="s2">from downstairs at my building.</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.031" end="01:00:16.731" style="s2">The security footage shows it all.</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.831" end="01:00:19.031" style="s2">They&#39;re all in on it.</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.731" end="01:00:20.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She bought them off long ago. I&#39;m the</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.031" end="01:00:22.931" style="s2">one they kidnapped.</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.731" end="01:00:24.731" style="s2">Look at these injuries.</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.931" end="01:00:27.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s telling the truth?</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.731" end="01:00:27.931" style="s2">Depends on the evidence.</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.031" end="01:00:34.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In my past life, you cut my recording</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.731" end="01:00:36.331" style="s2">and got me killed.</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.131" end="01:00:38.731" style="s2">But this time, I&#39;ll use a recording to</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.331" end="01:00:39.531" style="s2">expose it all. My recorder caught</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.731" end="01:00:42.231" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.531" end="01:00:45.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My group sells each clip for $500. He</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.231" end="01:00:46.431" style="s2">owes me $300,000. No footage, I&#39;ll take</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.131" end="01:00:48.031" style="s2">a person.</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.431" end="01:00:49.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, you&#39;re the group&#39;s fresh</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.031" end="01:00:51.131" style="s2">merchandise.</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.631" end="01:00:52.631" style="s2">Ethan die.</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.131" end="01:00:53.431" style="s2">She</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.631" end="01:00:55.931" style="s2">is there</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.431" end="01:00:55.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take all.</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.731" end="01:01:03.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do you always win?</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.031" end="01:01:07.231" style="s2">You didn&#39;t lose to me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.131" end="01:01:07.231" style="s2">You lost to every choice you ever made.</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.131" end="01:01:14.731" style="s2">In my past life, I cried out non-stop.</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.031" end="01:01:17.632" style="s2">No one believed me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.731" end="01:01:20.732" style="s2">This time around, everyone finally heard</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.632" end="01:01:20.732" style="s2">what I had to say.</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.832" end="01:01:25.732" style="s2">You tried my door drunk that night.</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.232" end="01:01:38.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This has a camera, too.</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.032" end="01:01:40.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I filmed the door gap that night. I kept</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.032" end="01:01:42.732" style="s2">the video.</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.432" end="01:01:46.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Raw hallway footage.</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.732" end="01:01:46.532" style="s2">Lucy&#39;s dragged away on it, too.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.032" end="01:01:51.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We got the evidence.</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.632" end="01:01:53.132" style="s2">Also, we just got word</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.032" end="01:01:55.132" style="s2">Ethan was taken to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:01:53.132" end="01:01:58.332" style="s2">They couldn&#39;t save him.</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.132" end="01:01:58.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He brought it on himself.</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.032" end="01:02:06.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I bought the medicine. Does your hand</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.732" end="01:02:08.932" style="s2">still hurt?</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.432" end="01:02:11.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What I said about you in the break room,</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.932" end="01:02:11.532" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.732" end="01:02:15.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go home and heal up.</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.532" end="01:02:18.232" style="s2">I&#39;ll save the project for you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.532" end="01:02:20.232" style="s2">No one can take it.</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.232" end="01:02:24.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.232" end="01:02:24.132" style="s2">Look at what&#39;s trending, Has Hawn.</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.732" end="01:02:28.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Spliced audio, spread sexual rumors,</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.832" end="01:02:30.932" style="s2">helped her boyfriend scam people.</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.932" end="01:02:33.232" style="s2">She&#39;s the real evil roommate.</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.932" end="01:02:34.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was AI face-swapped. She nearly drove</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.232" end="01:02:36.332" style="s2">me to suicide.</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.632" end="01:02:38.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The evil roommate.</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.332" end="01:02:40.432" style="s2">My past life, those four words were</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.632" end="01:02:44.732" style="s2">aimed at me.</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.432" end="01:02:44.732" style="s2">Now the label fits its true owner.</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.932" end="01:02:49.832" style="s2">Dana said she changed the locks and</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.632" end="01:02:51.432" style="s2">added cameras.</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.832" end="01:02:52.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When you&#39;ve healed up, come back for hot</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.432" end="01:02:55.132" style="s2">pot.</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.932" end="01:02:55.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.732" end="01:02:59.932" style="s2">Dana says this place is safer now than</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.732" end="01:03:01.732" style="s2">her own home.</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.932" end="01:03:05.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; New locks, cameras installed, rent&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.732" end="01:03:05.332" style="s2">down $200, too.</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.232" end="01:03:10.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I checked the news again today.</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.032" end="01:03:14.232" style="s2">The spy cam ring had 11 members</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.532" end="01:03:16.332" style="s2">arrested. Victor was sentenced.</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.232" end="01:03:19.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Several women came forward to testify.</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.332" end="01:03:19.332" style="s2">He&#39;ll never get out.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.333" end="01:03:23.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan&#39;s mom came for his things and</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.033" end="01:03:25.433" style="s2">found out he was buried in debt.</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.433" end="01:03:27.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clara lost the baby.</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.433" end="01:03:28.633" style="s2">Murder and framing will mean years in</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.533" end="01:03:30.433" style="s2">prison for her.</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.633" end="01:03:32.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the path she chose.</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.433" end="01:03:34.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy, why don&#39;t you move back? That</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.733" end="01:03:36.833" style="s2">bed&#39;s just sitting empty anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.633" end="01:03:36.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.633" end="01:03:42.133" style="s2">Then come by for dinner often.</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.833" end="01:03:42.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.133" end="01:03:50.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi. I&#39;d like a long-term lease on this</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.733" end="01:03:53.633" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.433" end="01:03:55.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. Sign the lease tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.633" end="01:03:56.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In my past life,</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.033" end="01:03:58.633" style="s2">I spent a winter when no one believed</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.933" end="01:04:01.233" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.633" end="01:04:03.033" style="s2">This time around, I didn&#39;t save anyone</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.233" end="01:04:07.233" style="s2">or forgive anyone.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.033" end="01:04:07.233" style="s2">I just gave myself a door I could close.</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.033" end="01:04:11.933" style="s2">This is finally over for good.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
